nodes.prompt:
Write a short "$ARTIFACTS_DIR/README.md" for this image set. Include: a title, the source ({{inputs.source}}), the model used (fal.ai fal-ai/flux/dev), the style guide paragraph, then a table with one row per file (file name, role: hero or feature + feature name, size, exact prompt used). List visual-direction.md too. Only list files that actually exist in "$ARTIFACTS_DIR" (check with ls). End with one line of usage tips (hero images leave space for a headline overlay; feature images work as card illustrations). Do not include any API keys.

Style and prompts:
{{direction.output}}

Render results:
{{render.output}}

Reply with the README path and the list of files.
